# =============================================================================
# NEXUS — frontend environment template (apps/web)
#
# Copy to apps/web/.env.local for local work, or set these in Vercel for
# Production and Preview separately (DEPLOYMENT.md §4).
#
# Only `PUBLIC_`-prefixed values reach the browser — SvelteKit enforces this, and
# it is the mechanism behind the project's first security rule. Never put
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, an AI API key, or DATABASE_URL in this file:
# src/lib/utils/env.ts only reads PUBLIC_* names, so such a value would either be
# ignored or, worse, be readable by anyone with the bundle.
# =============================================================================

# --- Supabase (public by design) ---------------------------------------------
# Safe in the browser: every table they can reach is guarded by RLS.
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- API base URL ------------------------------------------------------------
# Leave EMPTY to call the API on this app's own origin at `/api/v1/...`. That is
# the default because it is the one configuration that is correct both locally
# and in production — a deployed browser can never reach `127.0.0.1`.
#
# Set it only when the API is on a *different* origin, and then also add this
# app's origin to the API's CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS. In that shape the browser calls
# FastAPI directly and the /api/v1 route below is not used at all:
#   PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://nexus-api.fly.dev
PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=

# --- API upstream (server-only) ---------------------------------------------
# Where the same-origin route forwards `/api/v1/*`:
#   src/routes/api/v1/[...path]/+server.ts   →   {API_BASE_URL}/v1/*
#
# Not `PUBLIC_`, so it never reaches the browser bundle. This is the variable to
# set on Vercel for the default deployment shape, and it is what makes the
# deployed same-origin path work at all — a Vite dev proxy does not exist there.
#
# Leave unset locally to use http://127.0.0.1:8000. In production, unset means
# the route answers 503 `api_upstream_not_configured` rather than trying
# localhost.
# API_BASE_URL=https://nexus-api.fly.dev
